  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Piau&#xED; Inclusive and Sustainable Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to improve the income, food security, access to basic services and adaptation to climate change of the rural population living in the semi-arid region of Piau&#xED;. The specific objectives are to: (i) improve access to water for domestic use and production; (ii) improve the environmental conditions of rural families and their surroundings; and (iii) increase the adoption of agricultural technologies, with emphasis on climate change adaptation and mitigation and the integration of small-scale producers in the value chain, especially women, youth and Afro-descendants.</narrative>
  </description>
